# This image's own ignore file (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore in place of the
# root .dockerignore, which belongs to the single-container image). An allowlist: the
# build context is the repository root, and the root holds .env, the browser profiles
# (.computer/) and node_modules — none of which may reach an image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/runtime/__init__.py
!src/runtime/computer/
!docker/computer/
**/__pycache__
